Package: afscOSA
Type: Package
Title: Calculate and Visualize Fits to AFSC Compositional Stock Assessment Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Cole", "Monnahan",  email = "cole.monnahan@noaa.gov", role = c("aut")),
    person("Steve", "Barbeaux", email = "steve.barbeaux@unoaa.gov", role = c("aut")),
    person("Jane", "Sullivan", email = "jane.sullivan@noaa.gov", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: One step ahead (OSA) residual diagnostic plots for 
    composition data fit in fisheries stock assessments at the 
    Alaska Fisheries Science Center (AFSC). For each data set
    (fleet) the output plots the fit aggregated across years,
    a Q-Q plot of OSA residuals, bubble plots for OSA and
    Pearson residuals. OSA residuals will be standard normal 
    under a correctly specified model and so statistics are also
    provided to give context to the fit and guide understanding
    of causes of misfit. See Stewart and Monnahan (2025) for 
    information on background and interpretation. 
URL: https://github.com/noaa-afsc/afscOSA
